145	// One CLI invocation across every fixture library at once (`--src` takes a
146	// comma-delimited list — see crates/cli/src/main.rs's `value_delimiter = ','`)
147	// instead of one process per library. Spawning 21 separate processes measured
148	// ~885ms dominated by process-startup overhead (~40ms/spawn), even though the
149	// tool's own internal "durationMs" stat for the combined single-invocation
150	// run is ~40-50ms — a single invocation is both the fair cold-extraction
